{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はレッスンとかでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと今日は\n生駒ちゃんパジャドラ公演初日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てもでも大好きだから\n個人的に嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/29/9864923/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊れるから生駒ちゃん忙しいとき\nいつでもアンダーに入るよ`・ω・´←え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日観に行きたかったなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか観たいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"席用意しなくていいから！\nロビ観でもいいから！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああもうオンデマで見ようかしら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりまね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんお疲れ様(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/29/9864923/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鯛焼きによる！\nカリカリのやつは比較的頭から\nもちもちのやつは比較的しっぽから\nって感じかなー(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/29/9864923/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでも好きだな～\nでもアーモンドチョコ、焼きチョコとかの種類より\nチョコの部分のクオリティで\n好きかどうか決まる(・ω・)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/29/9864923/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここ見てくれてありがとう！\nいつもやってるわけじゃないけど\n自主練で立ち位置の確認のときはたまにやる！\nあの日はかなメルでも書いたけど\n前日の夜に立ち位置かわったり\n覚える時間が無くて\n立ち位置の確認をずっとしてた＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メ貼るの遅くなりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/29/9864923/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月の生ドルに出てくださった\npaletさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/04/29/9864923/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さきもさんと木元さんは2回目\nみっきーさんは初めましてでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田がpaletさんのイベント行ったときに\n会ったことはあるけど(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Pigooでは\n5月5日（月・祝）25:00からダイジェスト版が\n流れるので\nニコ生で見れなかったかたは\n是非見てみてください(*゜▽゜)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}